@@ -6,6 +6,7 @@
 [![coverage](https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2FIstiN%2Fdmtools-agents%2Fbadges%2Fcoverage.json)](https://github.com/IstiN/dmtools-agents/blob/main/.github/workflows/quality.yml)
 [![Agent Docs](https://github.com/IstiN/dmtools-agents/actions/workflows/agent-docs.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/IstiN/dmtools-agents/actions/workflows/agent-docs.yml)
 [![md similarity](https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2FIstiN%2Fdmtools-agents%2Fbadges%2Fmd-similarity.json)](https://github.com/IstiN/dmtools-agents/blob/main/crap4dart.yaml)
+[![duplication](https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2FIstiN%2Fdmtools-agents%2Fbadges%2Fduplication.json)](https://github.com/IstiN/dmtools-agents/blob/main/.github/workflows/quality.yml)

 This directory contains the configuration and JavaScript logic for the **AI-powered Scrum Master (SM) agent system**. The SM agent orchestrates a fully automated software delivery pipeline: it continuously monitors Jira, triggers specialized AI agents for each workflow stage, and manages the complete lifecycle of Stories, Bugs, and Test Cases from Backlog to Done.

